+# registered here, on the web profile, and not on base, because its constructor
+# opens the database eagerly on activation — every profile would otherwise open
+# a SQLite file.
+# Restates storage-domain's whole config (a patch replaces, never merges): keep
+# base's JSON default for every domain, but route the `usage_stats` checkpoint
+# domain to the `sqlite` backend.
